This is a placeholder. To enable Stage 3 of post_analyses/stable_pair_examples
(and any other analysis that resolves ${GENOMES_DIR} from genome_list.yaml),
either export GENOMES_DIR or create a sibling symlink named
"annotated_genomes_link" pointing at your staged annotated_genomes tree.

For example:

  ln -s /path/to/annotated_genomes \
        annotated_genomes_link
  export GENOMES_DIR="$(pwd)/annotated_genomes_link"

The symlink itself is .gitignored so the genome files are never committed.
